{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 2532578842466874909,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Balanced Ternary",
      "source_hash": 10319074804755152608,
      "context_hash": 9358709295838526414,
      "translation": "균형 3진법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527176Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "![\"Setun computer using Balanced Ternary system\"](https://earltcampbell.files.wordpress.com/2014/12/setun.jpeg?w=300)",
      "source_hash": 5462093032874518239,
      "context_hash": 2000186918806550490,
      "translation": "![\"균형 3진법을 사용하는 Setun 컴퓨터\"](https://earltcampbell.files.wordpress.com/2014/12/setun.jpeg?w=300)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527177Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "This is a non-standard but still positional **numeral system**.",
      "source_hash": 4388940967775741341,
      "context_hash": 13381376180114853208,
      "translation": "이는 비표준적이지만 여전히 위치적인 **기수법**입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527177Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Its feature is that digits can have one of the values `-1`, `0` and `1`.",
      "source_hash": 2320584666154649221,
      "context_hash": 13821382330626370123,
      "translation": "이 기수법의 특징은 각 자릿수가 `-1`, `0`, `1` 중 하나의 값을 가질 수 있다는 점입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527177Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "Nevertheless, its base is still `3` (because there are three possible values).",
      "source_hash": 8766555688517668361,
      "context_hash": 1500702634723713822,
      "translation": "그럼에도 불구하고 밑은 여전히 `3`입니다(가능한 값이 세 가지이기 때문입니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527177Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:3",
      "source": "Since it is not convenient to write `-1` as a digit, we'll use letter `Z` further for this purpose.",
      "source_hash": 4397883239595266543,
      "context_hash": 16526205583756422249,
      "translation": "`-1`을 한 자릿수로 쓰기는 불편하므로, 이후로는 이를 위해 문자 `Z`를 사용하겠습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527177Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:4",
      "source": "If you think it is quite a strange system - look at the picture - here is one of the computers utilizing it.",
      "source_hash": 15804431592113338605,
      "context_hash": 16106222879335606448,
      "translation": "꽤 이상한 체계라고 생각하신다면 그림을 보십시오. 이 체계를 활용한 컴퓨터 중 하나입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527177Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "So here are few first numbers written in balanced ternary:",
      "source_hash": 14316682271727416695,
      "context_hash": 11080421010272638890,
      "translation": "다음은 균형 3진법으로 쓴 처음 몇 개의 수입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527177Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "This system allows you to write negative values without leading minus sign: you can simply invert digits in any positive number.",
      "source_hash": 4346563806050825934,
      "context_hash": 13237923274654787378,
      "translation": "이 체계에서는 앞에 마이너스 부호를 붙이지 않고도 음수를 쓸 수 있습니다. 양수의 각 자릿수를 반전하기만 하면 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527177Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Note that a negative number starts with `Z` and positive with `1`.",
      "source_hash": 18206901698580297881,
      "context_hash": 8550297869166519257,
      "translation": "음수는 `Z`로 시작하고 양수는 `1`로 시작한다는 점에 유의하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527177Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Conversion algorithm",
      "source_hash": 13842371901581496185,
      "context_hash": 3866152160201835073,
      "translation": "변환 알고리즘",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527177Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "It is easy to represent a given number in **balanced ternary** via temporary representing it in normal ternary number system.",
      "source_hash": 16982856480032006163,
      "context_hash": 12559755592201301818,
      "translation": "주어진 수를 일단 일반 3진법으로 나타낸 뒤 이를 거치면 **균형 3진법**으로 쉽게 나타낼 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527177Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "When value is in standard ternary, its digits are either `0` or `1` or `2`.",
      "source_hash": 2679703406347034524,
      "context_hash": 12428623410204454229,
      "translation": "값이 일반 3진법으로 표현되어 있을 때 각 자릿수는 `0`, `1`, `2` 중 하나입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527177Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Iterating from the lowest digit we can safely skip any `0`s and `1`s, however `2` should be turned into `Z` with adding `1` to the next digit.",
      "source_hash": 551739491370128810,
      "context_hash": 9051148669748348650,
      "translation": "가장 낮은 자릿수부터 순회하면서 `0`과 `1`은 그대로 건너뛰어도 되지만, `2`는 `Z`로 바꾸고 다음 자릿수에 `1`을 더해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527177Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:3",
      "source": "Digits `3` should be turned into `0` on the same terms - such digits are not present in the number initially but they can be encountered after increasing some `2`s.",
      "source_hash": 12563948425992238568,
      "context_hash": 10165496581110136726,
      "translation": "자릿수 `3`도 같은 방식으로 `0`으로 바꿔야 합니다. 이런 자릿수는 처음에는 수에 없지만 `2`를 증가시키는 과정에서 나타날 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527178Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "**Example 1:** Let us convert `64` to balanced ternary.",
      "source_hash": 15842718100235939721,
      "context_hash": 13497616850527234904,
      "translation": "**예제 1:** `64`를 균형 3진법으로 변환해 봅시다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527178Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "At first we use normal ternary to rewrite the number:",
      "source_hash": 887598095648210652,
      "context_hash": 8687125312329968115,
      "translation": "먼저 일반 3진법으로 수를 다시 씁니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527178Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Let us process it from the least significant (rightmost) digit:",
      "source_hash": 4230577816865832231,
      "context_hash": 5457830458498183834,
      "translation": "가장 낮은(가장 오른쪽) 자릿수부터 처리해 봅시다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527178Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "`1`, `0` and `1` are skipped as they are. (Because `0` and `1` are allowed in balanced ternary)",
      "source_hash": 8529397162650276314,
      "context_hash": 8638939838356540171,
      "translation": "`1`, `0`, `1`은 그대로 건너뜁니다. (`0`과 `1`은 균형 3진법에서 허용되기 때문입니다)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527178Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "`2` is turned into `Z` increasing the digit to its left, so we get `1Z101`.",
      "source_hash": 12607722550211485930,
      "context_hash": 9072572902412041882,
      "translation": "`2`는 `Z`로 바뀌고 왼쪽 자릿수가 증가하므로 `1Z101`을 얻습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527178Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "The final result is `1Z101`.",
      "source_hash": 10955921526434370674,
      "context_hash": 9219680288908185966,
      "translation": "최종 결과는 `1Z101`입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527178Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Let us convert it back to the decimal system by adding the weighted positional values:",
      "source_hash": 18214941752640818791,
      "context_hash": 5049983722519305169,
      "translation": "자릿값에 따른 가중치를 더하여 다시 10진법으로 변환해 봅시다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527178Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "**Example 2:** Let us convert `237` to balanced ternary.",
      "source_hash": 18093268070644648516,
      "context_hash": 12245876974728583337,
      "translation": "**예제 2:** `237`을 균형 3진법으로 변환해 봅시다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527178Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:1",
      "source": "At first we use normal ternary to rewrite the number:",
      "source_hash": 887598095648210652,
      "context_hash": 1670551766173445129,
      "translation": "먼저 일반 3진법으로 수를 다시 씁니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527178Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "Let us process it from the least significant (rightmost) digit:",
      "source_hash": 4230577816865832231,
      "context_hash": 3414424823522597492,
      "translation": "가장 낮은(가장 오른쪽) 자릿수부터 처리해 봅시다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527178Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "`0` and `1` are skipped as they are. (Because `0` and `1` are allowed in balanced ternary)",
      "source_hash": 9644191732169948242,
      "context_hash": 13072944602447894671,
      "translation": "`0`과 `1`은 그대로 건너뜁니다. (`0`과 `1`은 균형 3진법에서 허용되기 때문입니다)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527178Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "`2` is turned into `Z` increasing the digit to its left, so we get `23Z10`.",
      "source_hash": 9174952059859659584,
      "context_hash": 14459590936886252178,
      "translation": "`2`는 `Z`로 바뀌고 왼쪽 자릿수가 증가하므로 `23Z10`을 얻습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527178Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "`3` is turned into `0` increasing the digit to its left, so we get `30Z10`.",
      "source_hash": 3121555882343224733,
      "context_hash": 3590679910797002855,
      "translation": "`3`은 `0`으로 바뀌고 왼쪽 자릿수가 증가하므로 `30Z10`을 얻습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527179Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "`3` is turned into `0` increasing the digit to its left (which is by default `0`), and so we get `100Z10`.",
      "source_hash": 7852573438337208538,
      "context_hash": 11606721097479582010,
      "translation": "`3`은 `0`으로 바뀌고 왼쪽 자릿수(기본값은 `0`)가 증가하므로 `100Z10`을 얻습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527179Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:17/seg:0",
      "source": "The final result is `100Z10`.",
      "source_hash": 6067992349795337021,
      "context_hash": 17010838407724718255,
      "translation": "최종 결과는 `100Z10`입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527179Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:18/seg:0",
      "source": "Let us convert it back to the decimal system by adding the weighted positional values:",
      "source_hash": 18214941752640818791,
      "context_hash": 8137675307651964537,
      "translation": "자릿값에 따른 가중치를 더하여 다시 10진법으로 변환해 봅시다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T10:58:16.527179Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
